msgstr "Conserver le graphe sélectionné, les identités et éléments source ; appliquer les obligations canoniques du module."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/QueryIterationMonotonicityLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Candidate membership never shrinks between consecutive completed states. Example declaration: gmeow:QueryIterationMonotonicityLaw rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ."
